"file_name": "Meta_screenShot_GGC3.png", "id": "1993356388001791", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499626806_1993356391335124_6636500491149518991_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qLMK2yjK9iEQ7kNvwGwXs3-&_nc_oc=AdpLYAcRbJlpPGYzs1EbY836Ipn6EgznLXjnHo-i4cfBzTASHezRAw5NmfhDfaCfbtA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJiAdxR1OZNjWeVOZ6GpCPCEI7S7eSUIDckRnv2_i-mfQ&oe=6AAAB4CC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Meta_hero_V1_AI.png", "id": "2254509195300165", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_2254509198633498_7494383448543903464_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hqhr5d_5_t8Q7kNvwFBDeaP&_nc_oc=AdqmAfymIlSJalE3NrKtU7S_F610ohklztQbJXrKNQUE7vZo2KNNqJkwz8TBWKsp9Jw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJsWsXQhtSXhvBQffjixCpT0D6ZzyiyS0hc68pOEkKJZA&oe=6AAAA37A"}, "display_name": "Glitch Glide City", "keywords": ["online", "free", "casual", "action", "arcade"], "long_description": "\ud83c\udf06 Glitch Glide City: Run the System\n\nThe city is starving.\n\nGlitch Glide City is a social VR action game set inside a collapsing digital metropolis powered by its digizens.\n\nThe city has been overrun by corrupted AI creatures known as The Aberrants. The only thing keeping it alive is the constant flow of energy and resources brought back by players.\n\n{4199231057041626}\n\nYou are a BB (Byte Boi) \u2014 a digizen equipped with a Digibot, your digital companion and combat partner.\n\nThe city is always active. Freely roam, meet other digizens, swing through the streets, battle Aberrants, collect resources, and help keep the city alive.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Raise Your Digibot\n\n{1330959409120651}\n\nYour Digibot grows alongside you. Raise it, level it up, and take it into battle.\n\nChallenge other digizens to Digibot Battles using a unique VR tether and handshake \u2014 then let your companions fight it out.\n\n\u2694\ufe0f Fight The Aberrants\n\n{1109541758402702}\n\nThe city is infested with hostile AI creatures corrupted by the Glitch Virus. Your Digibot automatically locks onto nearby threats and fights alongside you while you focus on movement, exploration and survival.\n\n\ud83d\ude80 Grow Stronger\n\nAs you play, increase your Player Rank, develop your Digibot and unlock new opportunities across the city.\n\nFuture updates will introduce:\n\nCollectable Digibots\nDigibot Classes & Variants\nBigger Digibot Battles\nNew Weapons\nDigibot Skins\nAdditional Abilities\nNew City Districts\nExpanded Aberrant Threats", "short_description": "\ud83c\udf06 Glide and swing through a living VR city, battle corrupted AI creatures, collect resources, and raise your Digibot. Team up with other digizens, challenge their Digibots to battle, survive the chaos, and help reclaim the city.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Your Digibot is your combat companion. It automatically locks onto nearby enemies and attacks while you focus on movement, exploration and survival \u2014 then take direct control and put it to the test against other players."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://outcre.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Outlandish Creative", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://outcre.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes":